B.boU=s(["At the first sign of a flush, pause what you're doing if you can.","Let your shoulders drop and rest a hand on your belly.","Breathe in gently through your nose for 4, letting your belly rise rather than your chest.","Breathe out slowly through soft lips for 6, a little longer than the in-breath.","Keep going, slow and unforced, until the flush passes.","It works best when it's familiar: practise for 5 to 15 minutes once or twice a day when you're calm, so it comes easily when you need it.","Also try: loose layers you can take off, a cool drink, a small fan, and noticing triggers like hot drinks, alcohol or spicy food."],t.s)
