B.c4x=new A.fJ("Reduce anxiety and stress with the physiological sigh","Andrew Huberman (Huberman Lab)","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rBdhqBGqiMc",null)
B.bMW=new A.hg("sigh","Physiological sigh","Two breaths in, one long breath out. The quickest way to settle.",B.bnQ,B.b0z,"A fast reset in the moment",null,3,null,"Breathing",B.c4x)
B.bbm=s(["Sit or lie comfortably with a hand on your belly.","Breathe in through your nose for 5, feeling your belly rise.","Breathe out gently for 5.","Keep it smooth and unforced for 5 to 10 minutes.","Some women find slow breathing like this helps them ride out a hot flush; it's worth a try when one begins."],t.s)
